WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
You'll know when they come back

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,800
How old are you to be so impetuous?

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:10,630
Good afternoon, Song Yi, Uncle Qin

4
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:17,280
Xiaolin, why are you here? Are you okay?

5
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:18,710
Didn't you ask me to come?

6
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:20,510
He said he wanted to talk about Yu Yu

7
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:24,410
Who is Yuyu

8
00:00:24,410 --> 00:00:29,380
You don’t know Yuyu

9
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:34,220
I suddenly remembered something else

10
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,420
Let’s talk about it later

11
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:39,960
Dad, Mom, why are you here too?
